            BlackBox Stub Components
            
            These stub activities, services, and content providers are
            required by the BlackBox virtual engine. When a guest app
            tries to launch a component, BlackBox intercepts the request
            and redirects it to one of these pre-registered stubs.
            
            The actual stub classes come from the BCore AAR library.
            Until the AAR is added, these declarations are harmless —
            they reference classes that don't exist yet.
            ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
        -->

